Files here: gpml.py, cov.py (covariance functions, Gaussian-likelihood inference, training and
prediction) and optimizers.py (the conjugate-gradient minimizer ``minimize``) are Python ports of
the corresponding GPML routines, modified for pyhctsa (MATLAB to Python/NumPy, restructured for
scalar inputs and in-process use). The Laplace-approximation inference path and ``brentmin`` of
GPML are not included. The ports are distributed as part of pyhctsa under GPL-3.0-or-later; the
BSD-2-Clause notice and disclaimer in LICENSE apply to the GPML-derived code.
